  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Grim Reaper** (1 other source): Included an extra verse taken from the song Sadie Sorceress [2]\n- **Shanghai** (1 other source): Stopped midway, then resumed with a jam using improvised lyric phrases [2]\n- **The Bitter Boogie** (1 other source): Contained teases for the song Crumbling Castle [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **It's Got Old**: back after 43 archived shows (454 days); rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2023-03-18.kglw2023-03-18.aud2.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 18 songs; 125 min [1]\n- **kglw2023-03-18**: source not stated; 16 songs; 125 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The jam was initially aborted due to technical issues before resuming [1]\n- Recorded approximately eight meters from the right side, in front of the stage [1]\n- A pocket watch was passed up to the stage before the song [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2023-03-18.kglw2023-03-18.aud2.flac16**: taped by John Porno; transferred by John Porno; source: Church Audio CA-11 > Edirol R-09HR [1]\n- **kglw2023-03-18**: taped by Tomcat; transferred by Twenty8; source: Edirol R-09HD internals [2]. Also: Recorded with internal mics on an Edirol R-09HD, transferred as WAV 24-48 [2]",
